Subject: [PATCH 16/24] feat(sort): add memory reservation logic for merge path
 sort

Add reserveSpace method to SortBufferMergePath to handle memory reservation
and prevent unnecessary spilling. Also add a test case to verify reclaim
behavior from OrderBy merge path.
---
 velox/exec/SortBufferMergePath.cpp | 43 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
